{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14368","headline":"同韦夏卿送顾况归茅山 · 綦毋诚","name":"同韦夏卿送顾况归茅山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谪宦闻尝赋，游仙便作诗。\n白银双阙恋，青竹一龙骑。\n先入茅君洞，旋过葛稚陂。\n无然列御寇，五日有还期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"綦毋诚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14368.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14368","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}